  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Wrist Doctor Surgery Simulator",
      "description": "The role of doctor is society is never being declined. They help us in recovery in any case of injury.  We often sufferer from many diseases and face many small accidents in our daily life. Then the only person who helps us is doctor. This game also provokes the profession of doctor among kids.\n\nWhat happened if you fell down and get injured your wrist. Don’t worry! Our perfect wrist doctor is here to help you. In this game, wrist doctor you can select a character of your choice and give him a proper treatment. So that, the patient gets cured and feels good. A large number of medical sterilized equipment’s are given for wrist surgery. It’s time to select the medical equipment’s which you required for treatment. This game provides you the opportunity to get familiar with different medical tools and makes you able to provide first aid in real world scenarios. The patient now in your hospital first removes the dirt so that germs couldn’t enter into the body. There is an awesome feature of bone x-ray. From this you can get the exact location from where the bone is fractured. Apply ornament, stitched the wound and put plaster on it. From this treatment the patient will recover soon and again able to live a healthy life.\n\nFeatures:\n=> 2 injured patients\n=> Several sterilized medical equipment’s\n=> X-ray features",
      "releaseNotes": "This app has been updated by Apple to prepare for watchOS 27 compatibility. No new features are included.",
